# Fleet repository code ownership (Q-GH1 posture).
#
# The `registry/**` zone is the human-PR-gated control plane: fleet topology,
# the fleet-root Application, the platforms ApplicationSet, and the
# diene-platform compiler chart. Every change to it requires a fleet-admin
# code-owner review, enforced together with the `main` branch ruleset
# (.github/rulesets/registry-guard-main.json).
#
# `platforms/**` is deliberately ABSENT: it is 100% machine-written (the T3
# materializer + the Kargo bot). The Kargo bot pushes it directly under the
# ruleset's Always bypass, and a human break-glass row change is an ordinary
# fast PR with no code-owner gate.

